  GIT -->|"repo_id · objects · PR / CI evidence"| DOMAIN
  DOMAIN -->|"accepted revision · context blocks"| KNOW
  MIG -->|"explicit guarded UP/DOWN · checksum"| DB
  ONBOARD -.->|"real principals · scoped project commands"| API
  DEPLOY ==>|"pinned release · runtime config"| API
  DEPLOY ==>|"operator-controlled migration"| MIG
  DB ==>|"encrypted backup / schema release"| RESTORE
  RESTORE ==>|"verified restore receipt"| DEPLOY
  DEPLOY ==>|"served digest · observation start"| SOAK
